  "generated_text": "To determine the total number of students in Misha's grade, we need to consider the information given about her position:\n\n1. Misha is the 50th best student.\n2. Misha is also the 50th worst student.\n\nLet's break this down step by step:\n\n- If Misha is the 50th best student, it means there are 49 students who are better than her.\n- If Misha is the 50th worst student, it means there are 49 students who are worse than her.\n\nTo find the total number of students, we need to add the number of students who are better than Misha to the number of students who are worse than Misha, and then include Misha herself.\n\nSo, the total number of students is:\n\\[ 49 \\text{ (better than Misha)} + 49 \\text{ (worse than Misha)} + 1 \\text{ (Misha)} \\]\n\nAdding these together, we get:\n\\[ 99 \\]\n\nTherefore, the total number of students in Misha's grade is \\(\\boxed{99}\\).",
